WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.652
The days are getting shorter.

2
00:00:02.653 --> 00:00:05.082
The air is getting colder.

3
00:00:05.083 --> 00:00:10.990
Jack and Sally go out to play.

4
00:00:10.991 --> 00:00:12.898
"Look at the squirrel!

5
00:00:12.899 --> 00:00:14.750
What is he doing?"

6
00:00:14.751 --> 00:00:17.301
"I'm not sure."

7
00:00:17.302 --> 00:00:20.216
"What are you doing, Mr. Squirrel?"

8
00:00:20.217 --> 00:00:22.404
"I'm gathering nuts."

9
00:00:22.405 --> 00:00:24.026
"Can we help?"

10
00:00:24.027 --> 00:00:30.569
"Oh yes, please."

11
00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:32.912
"What are the birds doing?"

12
00:00:32.913 --> 00:00:37.241
"I'll ask.

13
00:00:37.242 --> 00:00:40.563
Mr. Bird, what are you doing?"

14
00:00:40.564 --> 00:00:43.325
"We're flying away for the winter."

15
00:00:43.326 --> 00:00:44.678
"Can we come?"

16
00:00:44.679 --> 00:00:46.270
"No, you cannot.

17
00:00:46.271 --> 00:00:51.904
I don't think you can fly."

18
00:00:51.905 --> 00:00:54.408
"What is your uncle doing, Jack?"

19
00:00:54.409 --> 00:00:57.289
"I don't know."

20
00:00:57.290 --> 00:00:59.945
"Uncle Steve, what are you doing?"

21
00:00:59.946 --> 00:01:02.132
"I'm picking apples."

22
00:01:02.133 --> 00:01:03.495
"Can we help?"

23
00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:11.051
"Sure you can."

24
00:01:11.052 --> 00:01:14.095
"Hey, what is your mother doing?

25
00:01:14.096 --> 00:01:16.292
That looks like fun!"

26
00:01:16.293 --> 00:01:19.582
"Not sure."

27
00:01:19.583 --> 00:01:22.037
"Mom, what are you doing?"

28
00:01:22.038 --> 00:01:24.452
"I'm carving a pumpkin."

29
00:01:24.453 --> 00:01:26.233
"Can we help?"

30
00:01:26.234 --> 00:01:33.378
"Of course, there are many pumpkins to carve."

31
00:01:33.379 --> 00:01:35.444
"Look at your dad!

32
00:01:35.445 --> 00:01:37.577
What is your dad doing?"

33
00:01:37.578 --> 00:01:40.622
"I don't know."

34
00:01:40.623 --> 00:01:42.722
"Dad, what are you doing?"

35
00:01:42.723 --> 00:01:44.663
"I'm raking leaves."

36
00:01:44.664 --> 00:01:45.909
"Can we help?"

37
00:01:45.910 --> 00:01:48.528
"Okay, I guess you can.

38
00:01:48.529 --> 00:01:53.471
Here are the rakes."

39
00:01:53.472 --> 00:01:56.146
"What a big pile of leaves!"

40
00:01:56.147 --> 00:01:58.445
"Do you want to jump into them?"

41
00:01:58.446 --> 00:02:05.397
"Yeah, let's jump." "Wee! Wee!"

42
00:02:05.398 --> 00:02:13.323
"Oh no! What a mess!"

